{"seq":3,"slug":"popular-music","title":"大学音乐学 — 流行音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/music/music-history/popular-music","wordCount":2339,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学音乐学-流行音乐\">大学音乐学 — 流行音乐</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>流行音乐（Popular Music）并非一种单一风格，而是一个由市场传播机制、技术变革和青年文化共同塑造的广义音乐范畴。从 20 世纪初的锡盘巷（Tin Pan Alley）歌曲到 21 世纪的流媒体时代，流行音乐的演化始终与录音技术、广播电视和互联网的发展同步。学术研究流行音乐，不仅需要分析音乐文本（旋律、和声、节奏、制作手法），更需要理解其背后的产业逻辑、文化政治和受众心理。</p>\n<p>核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>布鲁斯与爵士</strong>：非裔美国音乐传统，流行音乐的两大根基</li>\n<li><strong>摇滚乐</strong>：从 1950 年代的反叛符号到全球文化现象</li>\n<li><strong>灵魂乐与放克</strong>：节奏驱动的黑人音乐演化</li>\n<li><strong>嘻哈与电子舞曲</strong>：采样、鼓机与 DJ 文化重塑音乐生产方式</li>\n<li><strong>华语流行音乐</strong>：从时代曲到当代华语乐坛的百年脉络</li>\n<li><strong>流媒体时代</strong>：算法推荐、短视频与音乐消费模式的根本转变</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-根源-布鲁斯与爵士-1900s-1940s\">一、根源：布鲁斯与爵士（1900s — 1940s）</h3><p>流行音乐的根基深埋在非裔美国人的音乐传统中。<strong>布鲁斯</strong>（Blues）源于密西西比三角洲的田野呼喊和劳动歌曲，其标志性的十二小节和声进行（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mtext>IV</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>IV</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>IV</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>I</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mtext>V</mtext><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{I}^7 - \\text{I}^7 - \\text{I}^7 - \\text{I}^7 | \\text{IV}^7 - \\text{IV}^7 - \\text{I}^7 - \\text{I}^7 | \\text{V}^7 - \\text{IV}^7 - \\text{I}^7 - \\text{V}^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1373em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IV</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9707em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">I</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">V</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8873em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）成为后世摇滚、节奏布鲁斯乃至流行音乐的和声模板。</p>\n<p>布鲁斯音阶在大调音阶基础上降低第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 级（Blue Notes），产生独特的忧郁色彩。以 C 为例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♭</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C - E\\flat - F - G\\flat - G - B\\flat - C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">♭</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p><strong>爵士乐</strong>在新奥尔良的多元文化土壤中萌生，经历了从迪克西兰（Dixieland）到摇摆（Swing）再到比博普（Bebop）的演化。摇摆时代（1930s-40s）的大乐队（Big Band）是流行音乐工业的第一个巅峰——艾灵顿公爵（Duke Ellington）、本尼·古德曼（Benny Goodman）的乐队拥有堪比今日流行巨星的大众影响力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-摇滚革命-1950s-1970s\">二、摇滚革命（1950s — 1970s）</h3><p>1950 年代中期，当布鲁斯的情感强度遇上乡村音乐的白人听众基础和电声吉他的技术赋能，<strong>摇滚乐</strong>（Rock and Roll）诞生了。查克·贝里（Chuck Berry）、&quot;猫王&quot;埃尔维斯·普雷斯利（Elvis Presley）、小理查德（Little Richard）是第一批跨越种族界限的摇滚明星。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1950s</td>\n<td>早期摇滚</td>\n<td>猫王、Chuck Berry</td>\n<td>12 小节布鲁斯，回声效果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1960s 前期</td>\n<td>英国入侵</td>\n<td>Beatles、Rolling Stones</td>\n<td>流行旋律 + 布鲁斯根基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1960s 后期</td>\n<td>迷幻摇滚</td>\n<td>Jimi Hendrix、Pink Floyd</td>\n<td>效果器实验，长篇即兴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1970s</td>\n<td>朋克/前朋克</td>\n<td>Ramones、Sex Pistols</td>\n<td>回归简洁，DIY 精神</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1970s</td>\n<td>进步摇滚</td>\n<td>Yes、King Crimson</td>\n<td>复杂曲式，古典融合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Beatles 的意义不仅在于音乐创新（从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 面单曲到概念专辑《Sgt. Pepper&#39;s》的转变），更在于他们证明了流行音乐人可以掌控自己的创作——这改变了整个行业的权力结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-灵魂乐-放克与迪斯科-1960s-1980s\">三、灵魂乐、放克与迪斯科（1960s — 1980s）</h3><p><strong>灵魂乐</strong>（Soul）将福音音乐的呼喊式演唱与节奏布鲁斯结合。底特律的 Motown 厂牌创造了一套标准化的&quot;声音&quot;：强拍鼓点、流畅贝斯线、弦乐编配和精雕细琢的和声组——这是&quot;流行音乐工厂&quot;的原型。</p>\n<p><strong>放克</strong>（Funk）以詹姆斯·布朗（James Brown）为开创者，将重心从旋律和和声转移到<strong>节奏本身</strong>。放克的核心是&quot;The One&quot;——第一拍的强力重音和随后节奏型的持续律动（Groove）。</p>\n<p><strong>迪斯科</strong>（Disco）在 1970 年代将放克的律动感带入舞厅，引入四四拍底鼓（Four-on-the-floor）、合成器贝斯线和管弦乐编配。迪斯科虽然在 1980 年代遭遇文化反弹，但其节奏基因直接催生了后来的浩室音乐（House）和电子舞曲。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-嘻哈与电子音乐-1980s-2000s\">四、嘻哈与电子音乐（1980s — 2000s）</h3><p>1973 年，DJ Kool Herc 在纽约布朗克斯的街区派对上发明了&quot;间奏循环&quot;（breakbeat looping）技术——将两张相同唱片的间奏段落交替播放以延长舞曲节奏段——嘻哈文化由此诞生。</p>\n<p><strong>嘻哈</strong>（Hip-Hop）包含四大元素：DJ、MC（说唱）、涂鸦和霹雳舞。音乐上的核心技术是<strong>采样</strong>（Sampling）：从既有录音中截取片段重新组合，创造新的音乐文本。1986 年 Run-DMC 与 Aerosmith 合作的《Walk This Way》打破了摇滚与嘻哈的界限。</p>\n<p><strong>电子音乐</strong>的发展与技术紧密相连：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Roland TR-808 鼓机（1980）的深沉低音鼓定义了嘻哈和电子音乐的底频美学</li>\n<li>MIDI 协议（1983）统一了电子乐器的通信标准</li>\n<li>Ableton Live（2001）使现场电子表演成为可能</li>\n</ul>\n<p>从底特律 Techno 到柏林极简 Techno，从英国的 Acid House 到荷兰的 Trance，电子舞曲在全球各地发展出风格迥异的子类型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-华语流行音乐\">五、华语流行音乐</h3><p>华语流行音乐的历史可追溯到 1920 年代上海的&quot;时代曲&quot;：黎锦晖创作的《毛毛雨》(1927) 被视为第一首中国流行歌曲，融合了美国爵士编曲与中国旋律。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时期</th>\n<th>中心</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1920-40s</td>\n<td>上海</td>\n<td>时代曲，爵士编配</td>\n<td>周璇、白光</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1960-70s</td>\n<td>台北/香港</td>\n<td>国语流行，粤语歌兴起</td>\n<td>邓丽君、许冠杰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1980-90s</td>\n<td>港台</td>\n<td>巨星时代，MTV 视觉化</td>\n<td>张国荣、王菲、周华健</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2000s</td>\n<td>台北</td>\n<td>中国风、R&amp;B 融合</td>\n<td>周杰伦、陶喆、蔡依林</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2010s 至今</td>\n<td>大陆/网络</td>\n<td>独立音乐、选秀造星、短视频传播</td>\n<td>李荣浩、华晨宇、各音乐综艺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>周杰伦的出现标志着华语流行音乐的一次范式转移：他将 R&amp;B、嘻哈节奏与中国古典意象结合（如《东风破》《青花瓷》），证明了华语流行可以在不模仿西方模板的情况下获得商业成功。</p>\n<h3 id=\"六-流媒体时代的变革-2010s-至今\">六、流媒体时代的变革（2010s 至今）</h3><p>Spotify（2008 上线）和后来的 Apple Music、QQ 音乐等流媒体平台从根本上改变了音乐的分发和消费方式。<strong>算法推荐</strong>成为听众发现音乐的主要途径，这导致了几个深刻变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>歌曲时长缩短</strong>：因为流媒体按播放次数结算版税，短歌曲的每分钟收益更高；2000 年流行歌曲平均 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 秒，2023 年降至约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 秒</li>\n<li><strong>前奏消失</strong>：歌曲需要在开头几秒抓住听众以降低跳过率</li>\n<li><strong>全球化加速</strong>：K-Pop（BTS、BLACKPINK）和拉丁流行（Bad Bunny）借助社交媒体突破语言壁垒</li>\n<li><strong>TikTok 效应</strong>：15-60 秒短视频成为新歌推广的核心渠道，&quot;副歌先行&quot;的创作逻辑被进一步强化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>布鲁斯即兴</strong>：在钢琴或吉他上弹奏十二小节布鲁斯进行（C 调：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>7</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>G</mi><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C^7 - F^7 - C^7 - C^7 | F^7 - F^7 - C^7 - C^7 | G^7 - F^7 - C^7 - G^7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8974em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），尝试用布鲁斯音阶即兴旋律。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>节奏分析</strong>：选取 James Brown 的《Get Up (I Feel Like Being a) Sex Machine》，标记贝斯、鼓和吉他的节奏型。&quot;The One&quot;如何在音乐中体现？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>采样溯源</strong>：选择一首经典嘻哈作品（如 Kanye West 的某首歌），使用 WhoSampled.com 查找其采样来源，分析原始素材如何被重新语境化。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>华语流行分析</strong>：对比邓丽君《月亮代表我的心》与周杰伦《青花瓷》的旋律写法和制作手法。两者分别如何处理&quot;中国性&quot;（Chineseness）在流行音乐中的表达？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>产业思考</strong>：流媒体时代的算法推荐是否在同质化音乐创作？收集数据（如 Billboard Hot 100 的和声多样性研究），形成你自己的论点。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>查尔顿《摇滚乐全史》</strong>（Charlton, <em>Rock Music Styles: A History</em>）：以风格演变为线索的英文教科书，中译本可参阅</li>\n<li><strong>Jeff Chang《嘻哈这门生意》</strong>（<em>Can&#39;t Stop Won&#39;t Stop</em>）：嘻哈文化与社会运动的交织史</li>\n<li><strong>黄霑《粤语流行曲的发展与兴衰》</strong>：博士论文，难得的华语流行音乐学术研究</li>\n<li><strong>Simon Reynolds《回到未来》</strong>（<em>Retromania</em>）：讨论流行音乐的怀旧文化与创新困境</li>\n<li><strong>Spotify 年度 Wrapped 数据报告</strong>：观察流媒体时代音乐消费趋势的一手数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>流行音乐的核心驱动力是<strong>技术、市场与文化身份的三角互动</strong>。每一次技术变革（电声放大、磁带录音、数字采样、流媒体算法）都重塑了音乐的创作方式和传播路径；市场力量决定了哪些声音被大规模扩散；而青年亚文化、种族政治、全球化等社会议题则赋予流行音乐超越娱乐的文化意义。自学者研究流行音乐时，应当同时保持&quot;听众&quot;和&quot;分析者&quot;两种姿态——既享受音乐的即时感染力，也追问&quot;为什么这个声音在这个时刻打动了这些人&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学音乐学 — 流行音乐","id":"大学音乐学-流行音乐"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、根源：布鲁斯与爵士（1900s — 1940s）","id":"一-根源-布鲁斯与爵士-1900s-1940s"},{"level":3,"text":"二、摇滚革命（1950s — 1970s）","id":"二-摇滚革命-1950s-1970s"},{"level":3,"text":"三、灵魂乐、放克与迪斯科（1960s — 1980s）","id":"三-灵魂乐-放克与迪斯科-1960s-1980s"},{"level":3,"text":"四、嘻哈与电子音乐（1980s — 2000s）","id":"四-嘻哈与电子音乐-1980s-2000s"},{"level":3,"text":"五、华语流行音乐","id":"五-华语流行音乐"},{"level":3,"text":"六、流媒体时代的变革（2010s 至今）","id":"六-流媒体时代的变革-2010s-至今"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学音乐学 — 中国音乐史","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/music/music-history/chinese-music-history"},"next":{"title":"声乐技巧与演唱","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/arts/music/music-performance/vocal-techniques"}}